[{"title":"怀香坪三弟","author":"缪公恩","text":"迢迢复迢迢，相去万里遥。\n子在南闽中，桑梓乃东辽。\n明月照相思，徘徊已中宵。\n相望不相闻，霜空素影高。\n羡彼云中雁，行行翔以翱。\n羡彼庭下荆，比比枝附条。\n古人重离别，情非儿女曹。\n所重笃天伦，故以戒游遨。\n或云丈夫身，耿耿志云霄。\n尔我迫饥寒，区区谋斗筲。\n忆昔在京华，别泪湿绨袍。\n我东子则南，音问颇寥寥。\n云中道路长，谁为陟岧峣。\n经年或一书，每恨阻鸿毛。\n安得如黄鹄，振翮归崇朝。\n安得化游鱼，一溯剑津涛。\n妄念逐心生，怀思空自劳。\n何以解繁忧，聊以酌芳醪。\n把酒发浩歌，不复事推敲。\n愿言托长风，寄音闽海潮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12737,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春夜漫成","author":"缪公恩","text":"微雪初晴下夕舂，薄寒渐减气和雍。\n虚阶土润轻尘少，小榻人閒倦态慵。\n烟度柳丝风细细，冰消池水月溶溶。\n一瓯薄醉浑无事，卧听青云寺里钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12738,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登石台峰","author":"缪公恩","text":"杖策登山顶，天风鼓敝裘。\n唾沾飞鸟背，袖拂乱云头。\n青霭群峦合，澄波一水流。\n湾环含雉堞，倒浸石城楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12739,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"又一律","author":"缪公恩","text":"峭壁起层层，凌空倚玉屏。\n荒台馀石镞，断塔咽风铃。\n此日生春草，何年落大星。\n低徊无限意，惟有乱山青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12740,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄沈明经秀岚 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"劫来平地幻风波，磨蝎君偏命里多。\n片纸衷情言不得，沈郎腰瘦近如何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12741,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄沈明经秀岚 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"传车何事太悤悤，我亦多艰百感丛。\n未得一尊留祖道，至今想像梦魂中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12742,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过东村","author":"缪公恩","text":"芳草沿溪一径斜，绿荫垂柳是谁家。\n重来不见桃源树，何处东风问落花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12743,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与尚铁峰","author":"缪公恩","text":"四壁琳琅绝妙辞，如何梅澥可无诗。\n收花入砚香生笔，把酒当轩月满卮。\n三日从君藏雾豹，五年期子侍坳螭。\n王阳已著先鞭去，正是弹冠共庆时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12744,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访铁峰不遇","author":"缪公恩","text":"云关寂寂锁葳蕤，驾鹤仙人醉未归。\n一树白榆风乍起，青钱扑面学花飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12745,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"至双峰寺留宿 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"新雨湿柔沙，清溪绕岸斜。\n一轮残日影，几片远天霞。\n薄霭生秋草，微风拂径花。\n牛羊归牧笛，散入野人家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12746,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"至双峰寺留宿 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"岚气落高岑，崎岖石径深。\n空山惊马足，清磬豁人心。\n穿峡泉声咽，凌霄树影森。\n松涛传万壑，盈耳海潮音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12747,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"至双峰寺留宿 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"暂借维摩室，毡分十笏宽。\n蕨薇留客意，鸡酒故人欢。\n云净秋空碧，山深露气寒。\n老僧先入定，独凭石阑干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12748,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"至双峰寺留宿 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"杰阁倚诸天，当窗璧月圆。\n涧光澄夜气，山影淡秋烟。\n心目空千古，虚灵净万缘。\n非关灰木者，寂灭学安禅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12749,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"双峰寺夜作","author":"缪公恩","text":"夜气澄虚白露清，佛镫冷照石龛明。\n西风万壑吹黄叶，飞向山窗作雨声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12750,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山行遇雨","author":"缪公恩","text":"层岚结翠影霏微，拥作重阴没夕晖。\n十里云烟低野路，四山风雨上秋衣。\n青泥裹足胶难步，黄叶黏人湿不飞。\n蓑笠是谁驱短卫，一鞭得得快先归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12751,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偕竹町集笠山斋中夜谈","author":"缪公恩","text":"尘事多羁累，今宵共结欢。\n漫敲诗律细，不放酒杯宽。\n积雪烟光淡，空天月影寒。\n丽谯催我急，重惜少盘桓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12752,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元夜","author":"缪公恩","text":"火树银花十里宽，歌声喧入白云端。\n春宵素月无人管，任我凭栏彻夜看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12753,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题昭君怨","author":"缪公恩","text":"颜色好，黄金少，美人空向胡尘老。\n黄金多，罹网罗，黄金虽多终奈何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12754,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春阴","author":"缪公恩","text":"垂垂庭柳绿新添，风动柔丝绕画帘。\n十里春云飞不起，一天雨意压楼檐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12755,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送人","author":"缪公恩","text":"沾足春泥雪乍消，暖烟晴日永安桥。\n骊歌不挽花骢驻，莫遣东风怨柳条。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12756,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读渔洋秋柳诗书后","author":"缪公恩","text":"金粉繁华没夕阳，江皋新染夜来霜。\n萧条几树芜城柳，一片秋声入锦囊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12757,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"万泉河散步","author":"缪公恩","text":"不向云关叩佛祠，扶筇沙径自寻诗。\n檐铃语细东风软，岸柳阴移午日迟。\n为爱青山谋小筑，因临流水立多时。\n个中天趣谁能识，吟望春原我独知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12758,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凌晨出东门","author":"缪公恩","text":"凌晨出东门，春风吹我衣。\n明霞照远天，怀袖挹清辉。\n高低林莽间，野冢何垒垒。\n少老或不齐，贵贱同一归。\n或者木为薪，或者仆其碑。\n乃有高明子，慷慨有遐思。\n思欲乘白云，思欲茹青芝。\n蓬莱徒妄传，神仙安可期。\n何如卜林泉，饮啄随所宜。\n长眺及山颠，高歌溯水湄。\n于物无所求，生死任天机。\n乘时爱景光，无为逝者悲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12759,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晓","author":"缪公恩","text":"东风收雪晴，半夜春寒重。\n辨色纸窗明，晓角吹残梦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12760,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚步","author":"缪公恩","text":"屐齿閒行印绿泥，石桥南畔觅幽蹊。\n烟生野浦澄波远，树绕春城落日低。\n万里投书愁雁影，经年怀友怨莺啼。\n独吟沙岸浑忘久，新月如钩上钓溪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12761,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"缪公恩","text":"抱关击柝亦医贫，落落乾坤寄此身。\n万里风尘馀白发，一生花鸟负青春。\n文章必欲期名世，肝胆休教浪许人。\n今日闭门甘伏枥，不堪回首重伤神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12762,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"缪公恩","text":"三径芳尘掩绿苔，高堂虚敞四窗开。\n风前移榻当轩坐，雨后分花绕砌栽。\n乐趣只从閒处领，天机每向静中来。\n茶馀睡罢浑无事，吟得新诗手自裁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12763,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"饮酒","author":"缪公恩","text":"伏雨连朝长绿苔，一樽时对北窗开。\n谁云酒是消愁物，往事都从醉后来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12764,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"官学偶成","author":"缪公恩","text":"宵来大火流，节物动新愁。\n我自甘鸡肋，人将笑虎头。\n凉风生远树，残照下高楼。\n弹指成何事，萧骚短鬓秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12765,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨晚晴","author":"缪公恩","text":"长虹倒挂雨初收，几榻清凉四壁秋。\n飞尽碧云天宇净，捲帘风入夕阳楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12766,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"万泉河登楼感兴","author":"缪公恩","text":"溪上轻烟拂水流，凉波细草乍成秋。\n尚馀柳色舒青眼，未放芦花点白头。\n西岭云飞归别岫，夕阳人倦倚高楼。\n无端百感增萧索，安得忘情似野鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12767,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河上晚步","author":"缪公恩","text":"几株疏柳绕沙堤，野水平桥落照迷。\n一片凉烟飞不起，黄昏影里乱鸦啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12768,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"缪公恩","text":"银汉清澄白露凉，西廊月影转东廊。\n怀人耿耿不成寐，远雁数声秋夜长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12769,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浑河即目","author":"缪公恩","text":"漠漠青云掩赤霞，长河风急捲银花。\n空林落叶秋无主，一片残阳噪晚鸦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12770,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读庄子","author":"缪公恩","text":"生死须臾事，彭殇固可齐。\n乃知鹏运海，原不异醯鸡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12771,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早行","author":"缪公恩","text":"远坞鸡初唱，人家户尚扃。\n天光沈水白，霜色扑衣青。\n大野迷轻霭，寒空带落星。\n能知清旷意，不复惮劳形。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12772,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜行","author":"缪公恩","text":"暝色生岩谷，苍茫路不分。\n乱鸦惊夜树，故鬼啸秋坟。\n溪阔迷寒渡，山昏锁冻云。\n野途谁可问，败叶下纷纷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12773,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"缪公恩","text":"焚膏嫌昼短，掩卷一镫凄。\n凝雪侵窗白，寒星入户低。\n遣怀常觅酒，得句始拈题。\n深夜沈疏漏，栖鸡冻不啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12774,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"永夜静坐颇得幽閒之趣因成二首 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"人愁冬夜寒，我爱冬夜永。\n尘事白昼纷，意念深宵静。\n默默一编书，荧荧一镫影。\n无殊平旦时，令人发清省。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12775,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"永夜静坐颇得幽閒之趣因成二首 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"高空雪始收，古木风初定。\n冷月上疏窗，一片寒光凝。\n天机自奕奕，道心常醒醒。\n静坐数疏钟，谁与同清兴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12776,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早醒","author":"缪公恩","text":"微醺醒后烬炉香，纸帐寒宵布被凉。\n岁逼常愁双鬓短，梦回不耐五更长。\n欲教夜气涵天性，偏是诗魔扰睡乡。\n怪底冻鸡啼较早，误人颠倒著衣裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12777,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幼孙景逊教以唐诗多而不忘时向老母背诵以博果饵因占四绝句 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"风雪萧萧独闭门，竹炉拨火酌匏樽。\n新诗吟罢先登稿，更写唐诗授小孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12778,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幼孙景逊教以唐诗多而不忘时向老母背诵以博果饵因占四绝句 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"仅是三龄说四龄，丰颐细齿两眸青。\n一回雒诵清娱耳，字字珠圆水泻瓶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12779,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幼孙景逊教以唐诗多而不忘时向老母背诵以博果饵因占四绝句 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"探得曾萱小睡醒，携书读与老人听。\n开奁按句酬佳果，半日支颐笑未停。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12780,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幼孙景逊教以唐诗多而不忘时向老母背诵以博果饵因占四绝句 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"孙非驽钝母康强，有禄堪支一岁粮。\n领得天伦真乐趣，不须人事扰回肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12781,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞下曲","author":"缪公恩","text":"白草黄沙望不穷，旄旗大漠鼓天风。\n男儿未带封侯骨，牛斗□横剑气红。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12782,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读唐诗成绝句四首 其一 王颖川","author":"缪公恩","text":"格幽思远迥离群，太息桓灵枢密瞋。\n百首宫词娇妩媚，毫端现出美人身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12783,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读唐诗成绝句四首 其二 李玉溪","author":"缪公恩","text":"玉骨玲珑锦绣肠，齿牙吐出五云光。\n合当百宝流苏帐，金鼎常熏海外香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12784,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读唐诗成绝句四首 其三 李昌谷","author":"缪公恩","text":"万里沧波浩渺中，汀洲何必尽消融。\n自将浅易开生面，别有精神李杜同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12785,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读唐诗成绝句四首 其四 白香山","author":"缪公恩","text":"神仙岂合驻人间，白玉楼成即赐环。\n石破天惊难比拟，会须撞碎铁围山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12786,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十一月十三日忆三弟公伟","author":"缪公恩","text":"为底天南信，愆期不似潮。\n离情看素月，清梦度寒宵。\n时欲三冬暮，书仍万里遥。\n霞杯将介寿，应是忆东辽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12787,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十二月望观月 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"碧落群嚣静，清光一片寒。\n不知深夜里，耐冷几人看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12788,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十二月望观月 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"雪光飞冷艳，霜气淡寒烟。\n未肯轻归寝，重看待隔年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12789,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏镜","author":"缪公恩","text":"金水精华别有神，不须拂拭绝纤尘。\n且将玉匣收全象，莫遣清光远射人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12790,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"栽树","author":"张玉纶","text":"乞得蟾宫种，栽来灌溉勤。\n莫言枝干小，气象已干云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12791,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蛛网","author":"张玉纶","text":"垂处当檐角，团团带露凉。\n青蝇休肆恶，天网本高张。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12792,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高粱","author":"张玉纶","text":"芳名传蜀黍，嘉种遍辽东。\n盛夏千竿绿，当秋万穗红。\n影全迷渭竹，色欲艳江枫。\n漕运天仓满，飞随海舶风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12793,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恭和霍仪阁夫子沈阳书院感怀五言律严韵","author":"张玉纶","text":"蔼蔼春风座，雍雍大雅歌。\n胸襟媲湖海，文笔挽江河。\n立品秋金鍊，观书月镜磨。\n留都式多士，旧学那愁讹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12794,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答德翼文见赠","author":"张玉纶","text":"君素少称许，胡为誉独过。\n定知相爱甚，翻觉抱惭多。\n袜线难成寸，蹄涔苦不波。\n逢人休说项，无赖是狂歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12795,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠别王时泉","author":"张玉纶","text":"英气横眉宇，群儿那足论。\n相惊呼小友，溺爱等诸孙。\n鸢马閒情少，诗书素好敦。\n鹏抟知在迩，还望访蓬门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12796,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高粱","author":"张玉纶","text":"高颗大穗有光华，万垄参差斗晚霞。\n贡向东都充玉食，岂惟有米号桃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12797,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜雨","author":"张玉纶","text":"暗风吹送雨丝丝，洒竹敲窗漏正迟。\n可许为霖酬夙志，小楼听到五更时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12798,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"张玉纶","text":"银河一带影迢迢，此夕双星渡鹊桥。\n惟问西南新月影，团圞何不趁今宵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12799,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"文姬归汉 其一","author":"张玉纶","text":"万里驰驱趁夕晖，胡笳羌笛听全非。\n可怜青冢埋香骨，空使芳魂月夜归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12800,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"文姬归汉 其二","author":"张玉纶","text":"双雏远弃恨难销，史笔何须浪作嘲。\n不见齧毡苏属国，胡中生子得承祧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12801,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"管公屯怀古","author":"张玉纶","text":"高卧辽东万事空，几回凭吊仰遗风。\n三分鼎峙今何在，剩得荒屯属管公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12802,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋闱报罢出都门作","author":"张玉纶","text":"泪湿青衫出帝城，西风寒透此时情。\n不堪路遇东来客，苦问今科解首名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12803,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"姜女祠","author":"张玉纶","text":"无限波涛助哭声，女墙颓处见精诚。\n两辽妇节高天下，尽是贞风感被成。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12804,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其一 幽王烽火戏诸侯","author":"张玉纶","text":"离宫烽火暮云浮，甲马森森聚列侯。\n拚得江山博一笑，周王真是解风流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12805,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其二 昭君出塞","author":"张玉纶","text":"红颜薄命岂前因，一曲琵琶恨尚新。\n边塞安能凭女子，当年将相是何人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12806,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其三 敬德钓鱼","author":"张玉纶","text":"莫向奇功震海滨，藏弓烹狗事频频。\n试看江上垂纶者，曾是沙场惯战人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12807,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其四 长亭钱别","author":"张玉纶","text":"黄叶西风雁叫天，依依送别最堪怜。\n功名一事成何物，惯折人间并蒂莲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12808,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]